no – pro Kravaře, Hlučín, Hradec nad Moravicí i další obce. Web umíme zaměřit na celý region.</p>"}, {"_id": "b88e931", "tab_title": "Potřebuje opavská firma i polskou verzi webu?", "tab_content": "<p>Záleží na oboru. U obchodů a služeb blízko hranic se polská verze může vyplatit, probereme to v nabídce.</p>"}], "_css_classes": "ww-faq"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "3bcd322", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-light", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "poptavka"}, "elements": [{"id": "4e217af", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "79258c7", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-head ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "de0b06e", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "78b298f", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Poptávka", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "b34a871", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Nový web pro vaši firmu z Opavy?", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "d7bf560", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Tvorba webových stránek Opava začíná jednou zprávou. Napište pár vět nebo rovnou zavolejte – ozvu se obvykle do jednoho pracovního dne.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted ww-lead"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "d232831", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-contact", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id